                "title": "3 x 4 Solid Brass Parliament Hinge, Pair, Deltana DSPA3040",
                "description": "Deltana DSPA3040 3 inch x 4 inch Parliament Hinge Pair - 3 inch by 4 inch Residential Parliament Hinge. 5/32 inches thick. Tooled for a tight knuckle action. A parliament hinge is a butt hinge where the knuckle protrudes from the door so that the door when fully opened stands away from the wall. Designed for doors that need to swing 180 degrees and clear a projection such as a decorative molding around the door frame. It is often used on windows and shutters because this type of hinge allow them to swing past deep trim work. A solid brass hinge, it is available in 8 finishes.",
